@startuml 01-tool-execution-sequence
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #1976D2
skinparam sequenceActorBorderColor #426450ff
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #6C757D
skinparam SequenceParticipantBorderThickness 2
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #9bd0f5ff
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF3E0
skinparam noteBorderColor #F57C00
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam Padding 6
skinparam ParticipantPadding 25

title 工具执行管线：三阶段调度

actor "AgentLoop" as Loop
participant "ToolRuntime\n(ctx.tools L786)" as Runtime
participant "ToolLayer\n(L713)" as Layer
participant "审批/策略\n(interaction/)" as Policy
database "Session\n(事件日志)" as Session
participant "Consumer 工具\n(shell/fs/web...)" as Tool

Loop -> Runtime: tool/call (来自模型)
activate Runtime

== 分类阶段 ==
Runtime -> Runtime: executionMode (L1275)
note right of Runtime
  按执行模式分类：
  同步 / 异步 / barrier / concluding
end note
Runtime -> Runtime: createExecution (L1363)
activate Runtime #LightBlue

== Pre-execute 阶段 ==
Runtime -> Policy: tools/pre-execute (waterfall)
activate Policy
note right of Policy
  策略注入
  审批检查
  限制检查 (restrict L1070)
end note
Policy --> Runtime: 允许 | 拒绝 | 修改
deactivate Policy

alt 拒绝
  Runtime -> Session: append(tool/result) 失败
else 允许执行
  Runtime -> Session: append(tool/call)

  == Execute 阶段（并发） ==
  Runtime -> Runtime: dispatchToolBody (L1531)
  note right of Runtime
    barrier + 有界滚动池
    maxParallelSubCalls 控制并发
    pre 有序 / execute 并发 / post 有序
  end note

  Runtime -> Tool: 并发调用工具体
  activate Tool
  Tool -> Tool: 执行实际操作
  Tool --> Runtime: ToolExecutionResult
  deactivate Tool

  == Post-execute 阶段 ==
  Runtime -> Runtime: postExecute (L1741)
  Runtime -> Runtime: fuseToolSignals (L1888)
  note right of Runtime
    信号融合
    结果规范化
  end note
  Runtime -> Session: append(tool/result)
end

Runtime -> Runtime: notifyResult (L1656)
Runtime --> Loop: 工具结果
deactivate Runtime
deactivate Runtime

note over Loop, Tool
  三阶段管线特点：
  1. pre-execute 是 waterfall（策略/审批可拦截）
  2. execute 并发，受 barrier 与滚动池控制
  3. post-execute 是 waterfall（结果后处理）
  4. 所有 tool/call 与 tool/result 持久到会话日志
end note
@enduml
